00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:01,520
No, she won't.

260
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:02,719
Because he'll win.

261
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:05,200
My, let's talk.

262
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:09,257
There's gotta be another
way to settle this.

263
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:10,200
Sorry, hon.

264
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:12,200
I play Harpy Lady!

265
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:26,020
As long as my magic card is in play,

266
00:19:26,320 --> 00:19:29,177
every one of my monsters
falls under its control,

267
00:19:29,260 --> 00:19:31,860
giving them 500 extra attack points.

268
00:19:32,220 --> 00:19:33,400
Come on, Mai.

269
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,431
Someone's gonna get hurt.

270
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,873
Yeah, that's the point.

271
00:19:37,080 --> 00:19:39,860
Whoever loses the duel loses their soul.

272
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:41,640
No, I can't.

273
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:42,897
I won't.

274
00:19:42,980 --> 00:19:44,020
Look, Mai.

275
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:46,280
I'm not gonna lose you again!

276
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:48,480
We gotta stop this duel now!
